{"questionId":"u13-s014-v001","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-applications","skillId":"quadratic-consecutive-product","lockedSkillOrder":14,"difficulty":"basic","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"兩個連續正整數的乘積為 56，這兩數為何？","givenConditions":"兩數皆正。","target":"求連續正整數對","choices":["6、7","8、9","7、8","4、14"],"answerIndex":2,"explanation":"設較小 x，x(x+1)=56；根 x=7、-8，取正組 7、8，所以答案為「7、8」。 設較小數為 x，連續整數的下一個是 x+1，故乘積關係為 x(x+1)=56。候選組為七、八與負八、負七，題幹指定兩數皆正，因此取七、八；這組不僅乘積五十六，也正好相差一。","steps":["設較小 x，x(x+1)=56","根 x=7、-8，取正組 7、8","以數對七、八回算差為一且 7×8=56，再確認皆為正整數。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"6、7","truth":false,"reason":"乘積 42。"},{"choice":"8、9","truth":false,"reason":"乘積 72。"},{"choice":"7、8","truth":true,"reason":"7×8=56，且相差 1。"},{"choice":"4、14","truth":false,"reason":"乘積 56 但不連續。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"只看乘積不看連續 四與十四雖然乘積也是五十六，但不是連續整數，不能只驗乘積。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-area-problem"],"estimatedTimeSec":65,"unitCheck":"本題沒有需要換算的物理單位。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"需回報完整數對。","difficultyReason":"基本連續乘積。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"authoringIntent":"求連續正整數對","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"f86e931a8e3303dc0a34170d3be8ce5c5555db763edba8570194ffac7f2e8b72"}
{"questionId":"u13-s014-v002","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-applications","skillId":"quadratic-consecutive-product","lockedSkillOrder":14,"difficulty":"basic","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"兩個連續正整數乘積為 90，較小數為何？","givenConditions":"正整數。","target":"求較小數","choices":["9","10","8","15"],"answerIndex":0,"explanation":"x(x+1)=90；(x-9)(x+10)=0，取 x=9，所以答案為「9」。 將較小數設為 x 後，方程式 x(x+1)=90 得 x=9 或負十。負組不符合正整數，因此兩數為九與十；題目問較小數，應回答九而不是十。回算九乘十正好是九十。","steps":["x(x+1)=90","(x-9)(x+10)=0，取 x=9","從正整數組九、十中按 x 的定義取較小數九。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"9","truth":true,"reason":"9×10=90。"},{"choice":"10","truth":false,"reason":"這是較大數。"},{"choice":"8","truth":false,"reason":"8×9=72。"},{"choice":"15","truth":false,"reason":"與 6 乘積 90但不連續。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"把較大數作答 求得數對後若沒有回看「較小數」，容易把較大的十當成答案。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-area-problem"],"estimatedTimeSec":65,"unitCheck":"本題沒有需要換算的物理單位。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"題目問較小者。","difficultyReason":"基本較大乘積。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"authoringIntent":"求較小數","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"14bfe75f020188f8b8d86bd907b4fd7b06dd22d489690d15aa24b7dfd3c58f65"}
{"questionId":"u13-s014-v003","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-applications","skillId":"quadratic-consecutive-product","lockedSkillOrder":14,"difficulty":"basic","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"兩個連續正整數的乘積為 72，則兩數之和為何？","givenConditions":"兩數為正整數。","target":"由連續乘積求兩數和","choices":["15","18","72","17"],"answerIndex":3,"explanation":"設較小數 x，解 x(x+1)=72 得 x=8；兩數為 8、9，和為 17，所以答案為「17」。 先用 x(x+1)=72 找到連續正整數八與九，然後才處理題目所問的「和」。八加九等於十七；十八是把較大數九加了兩次，七十二則仍是乘積，都沒有回答目標量。","steps":["設較小數 x，解 x(x+1)=72 得 x=8","兩數為 8、9，和為 17","將數對八、九的乘積與連續性驗證後，計算所求和 8+9=17。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"15","truth":false,"reason":"對應 7、8，但其乘積是 56。"},{"choice":"18","truth":false,"reason":"把較大數 9 加倍。"},{"choice":"72","truth":false,"reason":"把乘積直接當成和。"},{"choice":"17","truth":true,"reason":"連續正整數為 8、9，因此和為 17。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"求出整數後未轉換目標量 解出較小數八後仍需先寫出另一數九，再相加，不能停在方程式根。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-area-problem"],"estimatedTimeSec":75,"unitCheck":"本題沒有需要換算的物理單位。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"完整根組為 8、9，但作答需回應和。","difficultyReason":"基本建模後再轉換目標。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"authoringIntent":"由連續乘積求兩數和","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"0ab69c813ee9df3b9dc2ef1b674e8b673717b2b9ea5b9bc630194a5b4736debc"}
{"questionId":"u13-s014-v004","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-applications","skillId":"quadratic-consecutive-product","lockedSkillOrder":14,"difficulty":"standard","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"兩個連續正偶數乘積為 48，這兩數為何？","givenConditions":"相差 2，皆正偶數。","target":"求連續正偶數","choices":["4、6","6、8","7、8","8、10"],"answerIndex":1,"explanation":"設較小偶數 x，x(x+2)=48；根 x=6、-8，取正組 6、8，所以答案為「6、8」。 連續偶數在數線上相差二，因此設較小偶數 x，另一數是 x+2。解 x(x+2)=48 得六與負八，題幹要求正偶數，故取六、八；七、八雖相鄰，但不是兩個偶數。","steps":["設較小偶數 x，x(x+2)=48","根 x=6、-8，取正組 6、8","以六、八檢查兩數均為正偶數、差為二且乘積四十八。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"4、6","truth":false,"reason":"乘積 24。"},{"choice":"6、8","truth":true,"reason":"連續偶數相差 2，6×8=48。"},{"choice":"7、8","truth":false,"reason":"相差 1 且一奇一偶。"},{"choice":"8、10","truth":false,"reason":"乘積 80。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"把連續偶數誤作相差 1 「連續偶數」不是連續整數，必須同時檢查相差二與兩數的偶性。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-area-problem"],"estimatedTimeSec":75,"unitCheck":"本題沒有需要換算的物理單位。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"完整數對。","difficultyReason":"同奇偶模型。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"authoringIntent":"求連續正偶數","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"73b986cd34c037920fa68d3232d64bd4525591780e13c53c18129263a97e621b"}
{"questionId":"u13-s014-v005","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-applications","skillId":"quadratic-consecutive-product","lockedSkillOrder":14,"difficulty":"standard","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"兩個連續正奇數乘積為 63，這兩數為何？","givenConditions":"相差 2。","target":"求連續正奇數","choices":["6、8","7、8","9、11","7、9"],"answerIndex":3,"explanation":"x(x+2)=63；x²+2x-63=(x-7)(x+9)=0，取 7、9，所以答案為「7、9」。 連續奇數也相差二，所以列 x(x+2)=63。方程式根七與負九對應正組七、九與負組負九、負七，題目指定正奇數，因此取七、九。兩數皆為奇數且 7×9=63。","steps":["x(x+2)=63","x²+2x-63=(x-7)(x+9)=0，取 7、9","將七、九代回驗證奇性、相差二與乘積六十三。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"6、8","truth":false,"reason":"是偶數且乘積 48。"},{"choice":"7、8","truth":false,"reason":"不都是奇數。"},{"choice":"9、11","truth":false,"reason":"乘積 99。"},{"choice":"7、9","truth":true,"reason":"連續奇數相差 2，7×9=63。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"忽略奇偶性 只檢查相差二不足以說明是奇數組，仍要確認兩數的奇偶性與正值限制。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-area-problem"],"estimatedTimeSec":75,"unitCheck":"本題沒有需要換算的物理單位。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"正奇數。","difficultyReason":"奇數乘積。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"authoringIntent":"求連續正奇數","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"5a915fbe396b88442b26c873a3deadc7e1d4b449b65c1d26df8d652ac5f48d3d"}
{"questionId":"u13-s014-v006","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-applications","skillId":"quadratic-consecutive-product","lockedSkillOrder":14,"difficulty":"standard","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"兩個連續正整數乘積為 156，較大數為何？","givenConditions":"正整數。","target":"求較大數","choices":["12","14","13","78"],"answerIndex":2,"explanation":"x(x+1)=156；(x-12)(x+13)=0，正組 12、13，所以答案為「13」。 設較小數為 x，解 x(x+1)=156 得正組十二、十三。這一題不是問 x，而是問較大數，所以應將 x+1=13 作為答案。十二雖是正確的方程式根，卻只代表較小數。","steps":["x(x+1)=156","(x-12)(x+13)=0，正組 12、13","由 x=12 寫出完整數對十二、十三，驗算乘積一百五十六後取較大數。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"12","truth":false,"reason":"這是較小數。"},{"choice":"14","truth":false,"reason":"13×14=182。"},{"choice":"13","truth":true,"reason":"12×13=156。"},{"choice":"78","truth":false,"reason":"把乘積除以 2。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"只回答設的 x 而忽略問法 未知數 x 的值不一定就是題目最終所求，要根據「較大數」再加一。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-area-problem"],"estimatedTimeSec":80,"unitCheck":"本題沒有需要換算的物理單位。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"目標為較大者。","difficultyReason":"解後轉換目標。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"authoringIntent":"求較大數","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"acb1dc3d756311205d68be0549ac8ab91ddbc83367757bfbca7d9c420519cc36"}
{"questionId":"u13-s014-v007","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-applications","skillId":"quadratic-consecutive-product","lockedSkillOrder":14,"difficulty":"advanced","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"兩個連續整數乘積為 30，且兩數和為正。這兩數為何？","givenConditions":"未說正整數，必須先保留兩組。","target":"用附加條件選正負組","choices":["5、6","-6、-5","3、10","-5、6"],"answerIndex":0,"explanation":"x(x+1)=30 得 x=5 或 -6；兩組為 5、6 與 -6、-5；檢查和，所以答案為「5、6」。 題幹沒有先限定正整數，所以 x(x+1)=30 的兩根五與負六都要轉成數對。正組五、六的和是十一，負組負六、負五的和是負十一；附加條件「和為正」恰好選出五、六。","steps":["x(x+1)=30 得 x=5 或 -6","兩組為 5、6 與 -6、-5；檢查和","分別計算兩個候選數對的和，以和為正排除負六、負五。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"5、6","truth":true,"reason":"代數有 5、6 與 -6、-5 兩組；和為正選 5、6。"},{"choice":"-6、-5","truth":false,"reason":"乘積 30，但和為 -11。"},{"choice":"3、10","truth":false,"reason":"乘積 30 但不連續。"},{"choice":"-5、6","truth":false,"reason":"不連續且乘積負。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"只因乘積正就自動選正組 乘積為正只能說明兩數同號，不能自動推斷兩數都是正。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-area-problem"],"estimatedTimeSec":100,"unitCheck":"本題沒有需要換算的物理單位。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"和為正才排除負組。","difficultyReason":"多組根與額外條件。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"authoringIntent":"用附加條件選正負組","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"8b30cd907aa0457e541ea384887c727511bfe658c18df499ac137057445c1ecb"}
{"questionId":"u13-s014-v008","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-applications","skillId":"quadratic-consecutive-product","lockedSkillOrder":14,"difficulty":"advanced","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"三個連續正整數中，第一個與第三個的乘積為 80。三數為何？","givenConditions":"三數皆正。","target":"求三個連續正整數","choices":["-10、-9、-8","8、9、10","7、8、9","9、10、11"],"answerIndex":1,"explanation":"x²+2x-80=0；(x-8)(x+10)=0，取 x=8，所以答案為「8、9、10」。 將三個連續整數寫成 x、x+1、x+2，題意給的是首尾乘積，因此列 x(x+2)=80。根八與負十分別對應八、九、十與負十、負九、負八；題幹要求正整數，所以取前者。","steps":["x²+2x-80=0","(x-8)(x+10)=0，取 x=8","以八、九、十檢查三數連續且首尾乘積 8×10=80。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"-10、-9、-8","truth":false,"reason":"代數也滿足乘積，但不符合正整數。"},{"choice":"8、9、10","truth":true,"reason":"設 x、x+1、x+2，x(x+2)=80，正根 x=8。"},{"choice":"7、8、9","truth":false,"reason":"第一與第三乘積 63。"},{"choice":"9、10、11","truth":false,"reason":"第一與第三乘積 99。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"只列首尾或未排除負組 方程式只使用第一與第三數，作答時仍必須把中間的 x+1 一併回報。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-area-problem"],"estimatedTimeSec":105,"unitCheck":"本題沒有需要換算的物理單位。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"需回報三數。","difficultyReason":"首尾乘積模型。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"authoringIntent":"求三個連續正整數","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"482141f3d82f3e3dad556835c0a58beed5cc036eea840acafd17d959756f3333"}
{"questionId":"u13-s014-v009","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-applications","skillId":"quadratic-consecutive-product","lockedSkillOrder":14,"difficulty":"advanced","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"兩個連續正偶數乘積為 168，較小數為何？","givenConditions":"x 為正偶數。","target":"求較小正偶數","choices":["10","14","12","84"],"answerIndex":2,"explanation":"x(x+2)=168；x²+2x-168=(x-12)(x+14)=0，所以答案為「12」。 較小正偶數為 x，另一數為 x+2，因此 x(x+2)=168。解得十二與負十四，取正根十二後，完整數對是十二、十四。題目問較小數，所以十四雖也在正確數對中，仍不是答案。","steps":["x(x+2)=168","x²+2x-168=(x-12)(x+14)=0","檢查 12×14=168 且兩數皆為正偶數，再取較小數十二。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"10","truth":false,"reason":"10×12=120。"},{"choice":"14","truth":false,"reason":"這是較大數。"},{"choice":"12","truth":true,"reason":"12×14=168。"},{"choice":"84","truth":false,"reason":"把乘積除以 2。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"角色或固定差錯 十四是較大偶數，不能因它出現在數對中就忽略題目問的較小數。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-area-problem"],"estimatedTimeSec":95,"unitCheck":"本題沒有需要換算的物理單位。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"負根 -14 對應負組。","difficultyReason":"較大同奇偶乘積。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"authoringIntent":"求較小正偶數","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"cdf5c7c75d3913f3ea6eaf268ccc49087f460e221a229eb813376deb0cf649d7"}
{"questionId":"u13-s014-v010","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-applications","skillId":"quadratic-consecutive-product","lockedSkillOrder":14,"difficulty":"literacy","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"置物櫃編號為兩個連續正整數，編號乘積為 552。較小編號為何？","givenConditions":"編號為正整數。","target":"求較小櫃號","choices":["22","24","276","23"],"answerIndex":3,"explanation":"x(x+1)=552；x²+x-552=(x-23)(x+24)=0，所以答案為「23」。 編號為連續正整數，設較小號為 x，便有 x(x+1)=552。根二十三與負二十四中取正根，得編號二十三、二十四；題目問較小編號，所以選二十三。23×24=552 也完整驗證乘積。","steps":["x(x+1)=552","x²+x-552=(x-23)(x+24)=0","將二十三、二十四代回，檢查連續性、正整數與乘積五百五十二。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"22","truth":false,"reason":"22×23=506。"},{"choice":"24","truth":false,"reason":"這是較大編號。"},{"choice":"276","truth":false,"reason":"把乘積除以 2。"},{"choice":"23","truth":true,"reason":"23×24=552。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"把較大數或平均猜測當答案 用乘積除以二猜平均值不會得到連續整數，必須依序列關係列式。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-area-problem"],"estimatedTimeSec":95,"unitCheck":"編號無物理單位。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"題目問較小。","difficultyReason":"較大數值的連續乘積。","literacyContextNecessity":"此情境資訊不可刪除且會改變答案，因為置物櫃編號的正整數與順序資訊決定根的篩選與問法。","authoringIntent":"求較小櫃號","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"5a2dab824abb894834d8c60dc8484132f61d0ac3334af60b6bfd56d98282c549"}
{"questionId":"u13-s014-v011","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-applications","skillId":"quadratic-consecutive-product","lockedSkillOrder":14,"difficulty":"literacy","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"階梯相鄰兩層分別放連續正整數個花盆，兩層數量的乘積為 420。兩層合計有幾盆？","givenConditions":"每層花盆數為正整數。","target":"求兩層總數","choices":["20 盆","41 盆","21 盆","420 盆"],"answerIndex":1,"explanation":"解 x(x+1)=420 得正整數 x=20；兩層為 20、21，合計 41，所以答案為「41 盆」。 設較少一層為 x 盆，另一層是 x+1 盆，x(x+1)=420 的正根是二十。因此兩層分別有二十與二十一盆；題目問「合計」，需再相加得四十一盆。二十或二十一都只是單層數量。","steps":["解 x(x+1)=420 得正整數 x=20","兩層為 20、21，合計 41","從二十、二十一的乘積四百二十確認數對，再計算合計四十一。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"20 盆","truth":false,"reason":"只回答較少的一層。"},{"choice":"41 盆","truth":true,"reason":"兩層分別為 20 與 21 盆，合計 41 盆。"},{"choice":"21 盆","truth":false,"reason":"只回答較多的一層。"},{"choice":"420 盆","truth":false,"reason":"把乘積誤當總和。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"求出連續整數後未相加 方程式根二十只代表較少的一層，不能在尚未計算合計前就停止。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-area-problem"],"estimatedTimeSec":105,"unitCheck":"花盆數單位為盆。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"需回答兩層總和，不是其中一層。","difficultyReason":"由乘積反推配置後計算總量。","literacyContextNecessity":"此情境資訊不可刪除且會改變答案，因為階梯兩層的配置語意決定最後要把兩個根代表的數量相加。","authoringIntent":"求兩層總數","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"75ee649c6362b5429dda0623d5999aa64a58f80ec1ea7adff0544a0b484cc6f3"}
{"questionId":"u13-s014-v012","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-applications","skillId":"quadratic-consecutive-product","lockedSkillOrder":14,"difficulty":"literacy","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"連續兩天的最低溫均低於 0°C，且兩個整數溫度的乘積為 20。這兩個溫度為何？","givenConditions":"兩溫度皆為負整數。","target":"求負的連續整數組","choices":["-5°C、-4°C","4°C、5°C","-4°C、5°C","-10°C、-2°C"],"answerIndex":0,"explanation":"x(x+1)=20，x=4 或 -5；兩組 4、5 與 -5、-4，依低於 0 選後者，所以答案為「-5°C、-4°C」。 連續整數乘積二十有正組四、五與負組負五、負四，因為兩個負數的乘積也為正。題幹明說兩天最低溫均低於零度，所以只能選負五度與負四度；兩溫度相差一且乘積二十。","steps":["x(x+1)=20，x=4 或 -5","兩組 4、5 與 -5、-4，依低於 0 選後者","列出正負兩組後，以兩溫度均小於 0°C 保留負五、負四。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"-5°C、-4°C","truth":true,"reason":"連續整數乘積 20 有正組 4、5 與負組 -5、-4；低於 0 選負組。"},{"choice":"4°C、5°C","truth":false,"reason":"乘積與連續性成立，但不低於 0。"},{"choice":"-4°C、5°C","truth":false,"reason":"不連續且乘積負。"},{"choice":"-10°C、-2°C","truth":false,"reason":"乘積 20 但不連續。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"只因乘積正選正組 乘積為正不表示兩個因數一定都正，題目的低於零條件才是選擇負組的依據。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-area-problem"],"estimatedTimeSec":100,"unitCheck":"溫度單位攝氏度。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"0 不包含。","difficultyReason":"符號條件選組。","literacyContextNecessity":"此情境資訊不可刪除且會改變答案，因為溫度低於 0 的條件是選擇負整數組的必要資訊。","authoringIntent":"求負的連續整數組","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"4b9bf3acf0d60e71142b1648cdc7bafd4f8f761e8ce1be68c5337cca015d5960"}
